The blocks no longer set outer margins or padding; `@plone/layout` spaces them. The room around headings and the title is set with `--block-title-spacing-after` and `--block-h1-spacing-before` to `--block-h6-spacing-before`. Renamed `--code-token-*` to `--block-code-token-*` and the inline `--cellBackground` to `--block-table-cell-background`. The table of contents' highlight and empty message use theme tokens instead of palette colors. @danalvrz
